WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Nexora Shop. Episode 1: Welcome to Nexora!

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.000
June enters the shop. Alex is looking at his phone.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:07.000
JUNE: Um... hello?

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:09.000
ALEX: Hmm... later.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Service fail!

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Pause! Alex ignored June. What did he do wrong?

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.000
ALEX: Good morning! Welcome to Nexora! How may I help you?

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.000
JUNE: I’m just browsing, thanks!

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:22.000
ALEX: Sure, take your time!

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Pause! June likes a phone. What should Alex say?

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:30.000
ALEX: That one has a great camera! Wanna try?

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.000
JUNE: Ooh, yes please!

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Service win!

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:36.000
ALEX: Welcome back, June!

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:39.000
JUNE: Hi Alex! My friend needs a new phone too!

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:45.150
Three ways to approach customers: Greeting: “Good morning!” Service: “How may I help you?” Product: “Want to try it?” Make customers feel welcome so they come back!
